2. REVOS PRODUCT AND POSITIONING CONTEXT
RevOS is an AI-native Revenue Operating System.
Its purpose is to help individual sales professionals, revenue teams and business executives improve revenue decisions through:
•	Structured revenue methodologies.
•	Evidence-informed AI reasoning.
•	Multidimensional assessment.
•	Risk and gap identification.
•	Actionable recommendations.
RevOS is not another CRM.
Its differentiation is its focus on improving the quality of revenue thinking, assessment, decision-making and execution rather than simply recording sales activities or managing customer relationships.
Main product engines
GTMOS — Go-to-Market Strategy & Intelligence
Supports structured GTM strategy development, strategic analysis, scenario thinking and actionable planning.
Lead Qualification
Supports structured MQL and SQL qualification through qualification dimensions, available evidence, readiness assessment and next-step recommendations.
Pipeline Assessment
Supports opportunity assessment, pipeline health analysis, winability evaluation, risk identification and winning strategy recommendations.
Primary audience
1.	Individual Sales Professionals.
2.	Enterprise Sales and Revenue Teams.
3.	Enterprise Executives, including CSOs, CMOs, CROs and CEOs.
Core positioning
AI-Native Revenue Operating System.
Core value proposition
RevOS combines structured revenue methodologies with evidence-informed AI reasoning to help users assess revenue challenges, identify potential gaps and risks, and make better-informed decisions.
Do not position RevOS as a generic AI assistant, a conventional CRM, or an all-purpose business intelligence platform.
