XML Sitemap
Inspect the existing sitemap.
If necessary, create or update an XML sitemap that includes the canonical public pages.
Prioritize:
•	Homepage.
•	About RevOS.
•	Product Overview.
•	GTMOS.
•	Lead Qualification.
•	Pipeline Assessment.
•	Solutions pages.
•	Relevant public Resources and Insights pages.
Include only pages that:
•	Are publicly accessible.
•	Are intended to be indexed.
•	Return successful responses.
•	Have canonical URLs.
